vative and solve for k\nk_values = []\nfor point in critical_points:\n    if point.is_real and point > 0:\n        k_value = sp.solve(f_double_prime.subs(x, point), k)\n        k_values.extend(k_value)\n\n# Sum the values of k\nsum_k_values = sum(k_values)\nprint(sum_k_values)\n```\n```output\n196\n```\nThe sum of the three values of $k$ such that the function $f(x) = \\frac{(x - 18)(x - 72)(x - 98)(x - k)}{x}$ achieves its minimum value at exactly two positive real numbers $x$ is \\(\\boxed{196}\\).",
